  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Inclusive Trade in Africa (SITA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the support to the SITA project, Denmark aims to improve livelihoods and economic opportunities through more inclusive free trade in Africa. The project will support the ongoing efforts to implement the African Continental Free Trade Area (AfCFTA), which presents a key opportunity to boost intra-African trade and increase exports. Complementing this work, SITA will address trade barriers at a regional level in East Africa, including through efforts to transition to greener forms of trade practices and support inclusion of women and youth traders in economic progress.</narrative>
  </description>
